THIRD-PARTY DATA
================================================================================

The derived series under public/ are computed from market data obtained from
third-party providers. Brent crude spot prices originate from the U.S. Energy
Information Administration series PET.RBRTE.D. The CC BY 4.0 grant above
covers this repository's derived outputs, not the underlying source data,
which remain subject to their providers' own terms.
